Poinsettias are poisonous if[ cats] eat them, so it[�]�s not the best photo to share because of that. However, my[ mom] has never had a[ cat] bother a poinsett[ia] – so she always left them out. My sister took this photo of my Rags when[ he] was 18 years old.
