> For more than thirty years[ Ken] Duncan has travelled the world capturing those precious[ moments] in time that not only[ can] record a[ history] of the world as it is and was, but so many more[ times] captures the true beauty of the world in all its many gu[ises]; magnificence, turbulence, fury and destruction, but above all hope and renewal of life on earth.
